      UniqueFactorizationDomain 
   Loading /research/test/mnt/ubuntu/algebra/DIVRING.o for category 
      DivisionRing 
   Loading /research/test/mnt/ubuntu/algebra/OAMONS.o for category 
      OrderedAbelianMonoidSup 
