      OrderedCancellationAbelianMonoid 
   Loading /research/test/mnt/ubuntu/algebra/OAMON.o for category 
      OrderedAbelianMonoid 
   Loading /research/test/mnt/ubuntu/algebra/OASGP.o for category 
      OrderedAbelianSemiGroup 
